WEBVTT

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.440
Accepted. Executing orders.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.860
You're...

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.900
System, activated.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.110
Field, generated.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.330
Null, eins, zwei, drei.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.540
The fuck?!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.910
Not being too talkative today, are ya?

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:40.550
Rebel 6: False World

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.050
Countering physical attack.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.720
Offsetting impact.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.680
You...

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.310
Dimensional concretization.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.730
You're a real pain in the ass, you know that?

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:58.400
What?!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.210
Are you certain I shouldn't intervene?

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.880
Yeah. It's just Lambda's maiden sortie, in the end.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.750
Just standby.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.840
Good grief.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.720
Hey, did you just hear something?

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.930
Who cares? It's probably just construction work.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.220
Maybe it's Mr. Ragna...

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.810
I don't give a damn about that pedophile!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.890
Let's go.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.570
God damn...

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.490
They just <i>have</i> to come when I'm still convalescing.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.330
Thanks for nothing, Nu!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.130
Now what? You're just gonna stand there?

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.500
I'm not pulling any punches!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.970
What's wrong, Lambda? Annihilate that man.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:03.970
That's an order!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.850
Ra... g... na...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:08.810
The hell?!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.850
Remnants of Nu-13's memories remain in her?!

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.350
Tager, transfer Lambda out of here!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.020
Move it!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.810
Here I come, you crazy tincan!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.650
I swear, she's a real slave driver.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:30.870
The Red Devil?!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.370
Hey, asshole!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.960
Ragna the Bloodedge, a message for you from Kokonoe:

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.340
"Your cooperation is much appreciated."

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.300
My what now?

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.590
What the hell are you wackos plotting?!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.430
Who knows?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.350
I sure don't. It's all Kokonoe.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.400
Every god damn one of them...

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.540
How can there still be traces of Nu-13's memories left?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.750
Is this an aftereffect of the Life Link too?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.830
This calls for a readjustment.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.670
Huh?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.090
Not a clue. You're better off asking someone else.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.010
Fresh fruits and veggies!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.140
Come and take a look!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.990
Dammit. He should be close.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.780
You must be the miscreant Jin Kisaragi.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:52.450
Huh?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.160
You're...

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.330
The name is Shishigami Bang.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.710
Bear witness to this scar on my visage.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.920
I cannot imagine you would have forgotten it!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.880
One of those defeated at Ikaruga.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.850
I shall exact my vengeance for my lord's death!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.810
You're welcome to try!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:22.900
Dragon of Destruction...

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.070
Honorable Death!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:31.910
Peculiar.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.490
Is this really Jin Kisaragi?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.080
So, he is wounded.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.130
<i>I thought that he might not be that bad of a person, but then...</i>

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.930
<i>We are enemies, in the end.</i>

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.680
It's gonna be okay!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.270
I'll investigate by myself to find the Major and Tsubaki!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.150
Miss Litchi?

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.690
So this is the place.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.530
I know!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.570
The Major might drop by an infirmary to get his wounds treated!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.950
Um, excuse me!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.010
So pretty...

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.050
I guess this is New Year's festival, huh?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.890
Go screw yourself, Library girl!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.850
Time's wasting!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.660
Where...

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.540
This is my residence.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.380
You!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.720
I wouldn't advise that.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.590
You won't be able to move as long as you're under this spell's influence.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.260
Why keep me alive?

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.680
Am I not the one who has robbed you of your country?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.310
Indeed you are.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.480
However, though you may be the object of my vengeance,

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:28.110
it would be a disgrace for a true warrior to take the life of a wounded man.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.610
Recover first.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:33.990
I will gladly challenge you again thereafter.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.950
At any rate, you should take it slow for a bit.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.160
Bang, could I ask you to get him a change of clothes?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.960
That shall be easily done!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.920
He's a good man.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.930
He calls himself a bounty hunter of love and justice, you know?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.890
A bounty hunter talking about justice?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:08:59.970
Why not?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.640
He's the kind to rescue a wounded man on the streets.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.890
Even when that man has done terrible things to him.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.600
And you are?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.730
My name is Litchi.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:11.610
I run an infirmary in Orient Town.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.070
It's hard to believe in this getup, but I'm quite skilled at my craft.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.200
Is that so?

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.070
Medicine of a bygone age...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.540
Compared to ars magus treatment, it's highly inefficient.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.710
Ars magus that makes use of seithr

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:30.250
is inherently a power that people should not be taking into themselves.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.710
The same goes for you, does it not?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.130
I'll leave the medicine nearby.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.730
I can move.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.730
Am I free of the spell?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.240
Sir Jin.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.420
Preparations for your meal have been made.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.460
Please awaken.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.130
Welcome.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.550
I'm sorry, but I'm not here for your fruits.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.930
Oh, so you're not a customer?

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.060
Oh, but I am. I'm looking for answers.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.100
I won't be needing a receipt.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.150
For a member of the Library, you sure are amiable.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.950
You must not fight Yuuki Terumi.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:50.670
With your Azure Grimoire, there is no winning against him.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.380
Like I give a damn!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.560
Are you sure you should have
lifted the restraining spell?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.570
I may very well catch you off guard and thrust my sword through your chest.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:23.450
I am not one to suffer defeat in such a manner.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:28.290
And besides, I could not exactly feed you by hand, now could I?

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.420
'Tis a tranquil town.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:39.090
As long as you are amenable to it, I would be pleased to show you the surroundings.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.340
The surroundings?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.350
Boss!

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:57.610
Hail! the new year is barely upon us and I see you are already hard at work!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.150
The quake did quite a bit of damage the other day.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.700
No time to be kicking back and relaxing.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.070
Take this!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.910
I see you're not
the only ones going at it.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.750
Boss! Boss!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.500
You're from the NOL!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.790
What do you think you're doing here?!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.500
You'll have to fight me before you dare touch the Boss!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.710
Me too!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:21.920
And me!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.180
This here man is my guest.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.800
Fear not, little one.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.260
But they...

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.980
...destroyed our home!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.390
And killed my dad...

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.940
True, we were defeated.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.730
We lost our country and those precious to us.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.490
That is precisely why, at the very least,

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.860
I want all of you to have bright smiles on your faces.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.790
Okay. I'll do my best!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.700
Excellent. Good lad!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.130
Sir Jin, would you care for some refreshments?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.090
That was laughable.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.340
You are the one who is consumed by your desire for vengeance.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.140
Such is our duty as warriors.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.600
I do not want the townspeople, especially the children,

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.440
to be consumed by hatred and resentment.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.730
A selfish wish...

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:20.360
Now, then...

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.280
I shall return without you.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.070
Sir Jin, you go look around town by yourself a little more.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.530
With no one to watch me?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.200
I doubt there is a need for that as you are now.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.330
Waitress, I left payment here.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:37.790
All right!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.420
Brother... Jin.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.220
Tsubaki!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.690
Why are you wearing that uniform?

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.320
I volunteered.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.820
It's my duty as a member of the Yayois, part of the Duodecim.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.950
I serve the Imperator.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.660
That doesn't mean you had to go to such lengths!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.080
Why join the disposal unit?!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.160
Brother!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.160
No, Major Jin Kisaragi!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:24.380
You are charged with the crimes of recidivistic insubordination and leave without permission.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.510
Defection charges also loom.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:27.840
Defection?

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:31.720
Please return to us. If you go now,

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.390
they may still consider your extenuating circumstances.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.390
I cannot go back.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.270
Why not?!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.730
There is still something I must do.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:47.400
Does it have anything to do with Ragna the Bloodedge?

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.320
These damn stairs go on forever.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.740
Screw this, and screw Nu!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.410
I swear, I'll slap that bitch next time I see her.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.960
Her, and all of those with her face!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.760
The, she's...

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.050
Dammit!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:18.020
Why do I have to feel pissed off about this?

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.150
Please answer me!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.150
It has nothing to do with you.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.820
Just return to headquarters without a fuss.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:31.860
I refuse.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.160
I will have you do as I say, no matter what.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.290
Even if that means having to force you!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.500
The sealed armagus Izayoi?!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.250
Tsubaki!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.380
Do you know what that thing does?!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.420
Of course.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.100
A light-blocking barrier.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.850
No one will be able to hear or see us in here.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:02.940
Brother Jin,

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.610
I have been ordered to kill you.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.240
But though it may be an imperial command,

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.660
I don't want you to die, Brother!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:14.450
So, please...

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.280
Don't do it, Tsubaki!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.030
Do not use its powers!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.740
You will lose your light!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.500
I...

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.710
What's the matter, Tsubaki? Don't tell me you're getting cold feet now?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.670
Looks like it was the right call to have my little friend follow you.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:36.180
Tsubaki, you bad girl. The Imperator's words are absolute!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:43.890
<i>An imperial... command... is absolute.</i>

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.900
She's being manipulated!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.320
Wha—

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.400
What's wrong, Yukianesa?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.740
Why won't you let me draw you?!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.740
Brother...

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.250
Sir Jin!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:22.520
B-Brother Jin...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.100
Tsubaki...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.820
Th-This can't be happening...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.870
No... No...

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.200
Sir Jin!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.500
Disappearance of the Power of Order observed.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.420
The balance might've tipped towards disintegration.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:57.340
We cannot afford to lose the Power of Order.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.840
I propose an event disruption.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:17:59.800
Affirmative.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.720
Case 685. Eliminating event distortion.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.570
Such is our duty as warriors.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.780
I do not want the townspeople, especially the children,

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:23.280
to be consumed by hatred and resentment.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.750
A selfish wish...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.370
Now, then...

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.250
It is time for us to return.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.050
Waitress, I left payment here.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.710
Thank you, come again!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:45.850
Pardon me.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.730
Is it possible to have a cup of tea?

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.990
What is the matter, milady?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.780
A world that picks and chooses only what is convenient

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.580
is unromantic in the worst possible way.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.790
Don't you agree, Valkenhayn?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:13.210
Aw man, that was actually pretty interesting,

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.250
but I guess I'll let it slide this time.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.590
We still have a situation here, isn't that so?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.840
Besides,

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:24.640
I have my own preparations to look forward to.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.560
<i>Sleep for now, Lambda.</i>

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:34.940
<i>I'm gonna have to equip you with the Idea Engine if I want to defeat that bastard.</i>

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.150
<i>Brother...</i>

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.990
<i>Yukianesa.</i>

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.280
<i>It won't activate.</i>

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.950
It froze my lord

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.460
and carved this scar upon my face.
That abominable blade of ice.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.610
Yet if it cannot be drawn,
it is no better than an ornament.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.130
Sir Jin,

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.470
mayhap you harbor doubts of some manner.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.380
What are you getting at?

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:06.890
I know this is sudden, but you should leave this place immediately.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:12.390
It seems there is a member of the NOL looking for you.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.850
I thought you wanted to fight me?

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.770
I recall mentioning doing so only after you'd recovered.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.150
And besides,

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:24.070
there is no fight to be had, not with you unable to draw your weapon.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:25.950
Make haste.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.830
Are you sure about this, Boss?

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.120
Yes. Let him go.

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:38.750
Once his wounds have healed and his doubts have cleared,

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.050
I shall have my fair fight with him.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.340
Have you looked in his eyes?

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:48.550
It's the look of a man about to face a battle he cannot win.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:51.520
My lord had the very same look in his eyes on that day.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.440
<i>Doubts, he said?</i>

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.020
Finally.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:17.540
<i>Brother Jin probably isn't there anymore...</i>

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.540
Tsubaki!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.260
Noel.
